### Create a new commit
POST http://localhost:8080/api/commits/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "repository": "6a0c5d47b45863402dc6c693",
    "message": "updated file1.txt",
    "files": ["6a05999949f210478aa6b392"]
}

### Get all commits by repoId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/commits/repo/6a05994149f210478aa6b38d

### Get a commit by commitId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/commits/commit/6a02eb6534318682d0e438ca

### Rollback to a specific commit
POST http://localhost:8080/api/commits/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "repository": "6a05994149f210478aa6b38d",
    "commitId": "6a02eb6534318682d0e438ca"
}